                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": true,
                    "src": "rate=k_2\\lbrack H_2\\rbrack{\\lbrack I\\rbrack}^2",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Since Step 1 is fast and reversible (i.e. equilibrium): "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": true,
                    "src": "rate_{1\\rightarrow}=k_{1\\rightarrow}\\lbrack I_2\\rbrack\\;=\\;rate_{1\\leftarrow}=k_{1\\leftarrow}{\\lbrack I\\rbrack}^2",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Solving this in terms of the intermediate I: "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": true,
                    "src": "{\\lbrack I\\rbrack}^2=\\frac{k_{1\\rightarrow}}{k_{1\\leftarrow}}\\lbrack I_2\\rbrack",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Then substituting [I]2 into the rate law for the rate-limiting step: "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": true,
                    "src": "rate=k_2\\lbrack H_2\\rbrack\\left(\\frac{k_{1\\rightarrow}\\lbrack I_2\\rbrack}{k_{1\\leftarrow}}\\right)^\\frac12",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and combining the k values and simplifying: "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": true,
                    "src": " rate=k\\lbrack H_2\\rbrack{\\lbrack I_2\\rbrack}",
